OL,3,GNEWSA'Devious' scout leader jailed over
OL,4,Achild sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "manipulative and devious" former
OL,7,Fscout leader who lured a young girl
OL,8,Finto the woods to sexually assault her
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for 20 years and eight
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FMatt Ellett, 32, from Taunton in
OL,13,FSomerset, was unanimously convicted of
OL,14,F19 sexual offences against multiple
OL,15,Fchildren by a jury on 5 August.
OL,17,FThe court heard he abused his position
OL,18,Fof trust by befriending the victims
OL,19,Fthrough his voluntary role, before
OL,20,Fsexually abusing them over a five-year
OL,21,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
