OL,3,GNEWSA'Devious' scout leader jailed over
OL,4,Achild sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing him on Monday, Judge Richard
OL,7,FShepherd described Ellett as a "skilled
OL,8,Fliar" and a "coward", who had coerced
OL,9,Fthe victims into staying quiet by
OL,10,Fthreatening to take his own life.
